<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
<a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<main id="main">

  <section class="hero hero--page">
    <div class="hero__media"><img src="<%= site.images.bullRidingHero %>" alt="Alexander Lovelady bull riding"></div>
    <div class="hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container hero__content">
      <div class="hero__kicker"><%= site.region %></div>
      <h1 class="h1">Nine years of persistence. One breakthrough ride.</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">At my most recent rodeo I earned my first qualified ride and finished second. That result proved the work is moving in the right direction — and gave me a foundation to build the 2027 season on.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="/sponsors" class="btn btn-primary">2027 Sponsorship</a>
        <a href="<%= site.social.youtubeUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Watch on YouTube</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat__num"><%= ridingYears %></div><div class="stat__label">Years riding, since 2017</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat__num">SEBRA</div><div class="stat__label">+ local jackpots</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat__num">NC</div><div class="stat__label">Regional circuit</div></div>
        <div class="stat"><div class="stat__num">2027</div><div class="stat__label">Season now building</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">The journey</div>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:48px;">Nine years, one chute at a time.</h2>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline__item">
          <div class="timeline__year">2017</div>
          <h3 class="h3">Started bull riding</h3>
          <p>Got on my first bull and started the long process of learning the sport — entering local jackpots and SEBRA events around northeastern North Carolina.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__item">
          <div class="timeline__year">2017 – 2025</div>
          <h3 class="h3">Nine years of reps</h3>
          <p>Years of entries, training, setbacks, and repetition — the unglamorous work that never shows up in a highlight reel but is the entire reason a qualified ride is possible at all.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__item">
          <div class="timeline__year">August 22, 2026</div>
          <h3 class="h3">First qualified ride — 2nd place</h3>
          <p>The breakthrough. My first qualified ride, and a second-place finish in the same rodeo. Proof the work was pointed in the right direction.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline__item">
          <div class="timeline__year">2027</div>
          <h3 class="h3">Building the season</h3>
          <p>Competing regularly at regional events, chasing more qualified rides and consistent results, and documenting all of it for TikTok and YouTube.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark section--line-top">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">From the arena</div>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:36px;">Photos</h2>
      <div class="gallery">
        <% site.gallery.forEach(function(img) { %>
        <div class="gallery__item">
          <img src="<%= img.src %>" alt="<%= img.alt %>" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
      <p class="small" style="margin-top:24px;">More ride photos and clips go up on <a href="<%= site.social.tiktokUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--copper-light); text-decoration:underline;">TikTok</a> and <a href="<%= site.social.youtubeUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--copper-light); text-decoration:underline;">YouTube</a> throughout the season.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--light section--line-top">
    <div class="container center" style="max-width:640px;">
      <div class="eyebrow center">2027 season</div>
      <h2 class="h2">Want to be part of the next chapter?</h2>
      <p class="lede center" style="margin:0 auto 28px;">I'm looking for sponsors who want to join the story while the audience and competition schedule are still growing.</p>
      <a href="/sponsors" class="btn btn-primary">See sponsorship packages</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
